{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-8822-1",
  "summary": "libwebsockets vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that Libwebsockets incorrectly handled certain SSH\nprotocol messages in its SSH protocol handler. A remote attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause Libwebsockets to consume excessive\nresources, resulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2026-10650)\n\nIt was discovered that Libwebsockets incorrectly handled certain malformed\nCBOR data. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause\nLibwebsockets to crash, resulting in a denial of service, or execute\narbitrary code. This issue only affected Ubuntu 24.04 LTS and Ubuntu 26.04\nLTS. (CVE-2026-78161)",
